# Writer 11 (tally 2.1, 2.1-3). L §2.3 parse rule 7: "An of belongs to the read its production gives it: a balance's
# comes before its projection clauses (bal(x, d) of p from t)"; balx = ... ["of" ofq] [proj | "modelled"], so an of after
# the projection's from term isn't the grammar's: LOAD-PARSE.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
def x: money PLN = bal(konto, 2026-06-30) from 2026-01-31 of ania at 2026-01-01
ask q: x
=== expect
refused: LOAD-PARSE ...
